{"id":"en_wait-i-have-seven-wives","title":"Wait! I Have SEVEN Wives?!","titleEn":"Wait! I Have SEVEN Wives?!","description":"A hidden sect’s only heir leaves the mountain to locate the seven legendary female elders who are central to his mission. He brings formidable abilities into the city, where their favor surrounds him as he heals people near death and defeats those who do wrong, gradually forging a reputation. With the sect’s future seemingly assured, the emergence of old adversaries raises a question: will the elders remain loyal to him?","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/wait-i-have-seven-wives/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/wait-i-have-seven-wives/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Counterattack","Life OL","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dklas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_wait-i-have-seven-wives_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dklas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wait-i-have-seven-wives_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dklas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wait-i-have-seven-wives_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dklas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wait-i-have-seven-wives_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dklas/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_wait-i-have-seven-wives_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":